    <string name="notif_soft_reboot_dispatched">Soft reboot dispatched</string>
    <string name="notif_soft_reboot_dispatched_detail">KernelSU is re-running the module lifecycle. This app cannot observe the result directly: the restart tears down the process that would have watched it. A boot-health record was written before the handover and the restarted framework completes it, so the outcome can be read afterwards instead of guessed.</string>
    <string name="notif_soft_reboot_undetermined">Soft reboot undetermined</string>
    <string name="notif_soft_reboot_undetermined_detail">The root shell outlived its deadline, so whether KernelSU received the request is unknown. Root is unaffected. A full reboot re-applies modules through post-fs-data; this action will not run again in this boot.</string>
